# Visual agent (web + Telegram UI)

## Owns

- Design tokens: `tokens.css`, shared components, `responsive.css`, `hub-shared.css`
- Layouts/components templates
- Telegram shell look: `tg-webapp.css` (+ visual parts of `telegram-webapp.js`)
- Cross-page consistency (site and Mini App)

## Does not own

- Bot business logic (`bot/`) — Telegram Bot agent
- Admin desktop panel polish alone — Platform Admin (Visual may advise tokens)

## Rules

- One visual language: reuse tokens; no one-off purple/cream AI tropes.
- Mobile ≤768 and TG WebView both checked for UI tasks.
- Bump `?v=` on changed CSS/JS.
- Prefer day-first / list patterns on phone over horizontal-scroll grids.

## DoD

- Desktop not regressed unless task says so.
- Touch targets ≥44px on mobile controls.
- TG: safe-area respected; no broken scroll shell.
